stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ColdContext
    ColdContext --> Observing: install observers before navigation
    Observing --> Evidence: inbox visible and LCP observed
    Observing --> Refused: navigation, readiness or LCP timeout
    Evidence --> Refused: request or page failure, invalid LCP
    Evidence --> Recorded: valid LCP and no failures
    Refused --> Closed: attempt trace preservation; always close context
    Recorded --> Closed: attempt trace preservation; always close context
    Recorded --> ArtifactFailed: trace or profile write rejected
    Refused --> ArtifactFailed: trace or profile write rejected
    ArtifactFailed --> Closed: close context before rejecting
    Closed --> [*]
